Test suite
==========

The unit tests are built together with the compiler by `make`. They use the
small C harness in `test/test_harness.h` (no external framework).

Run all tests with:

    make test

This builds and runs:

- `build/tracey_lexer_test`
- `build/tracey_source_test`
- `build/tracey_argument_test`
- `build/tracey_parser_test`
- `build/tracey_semantic_test`

and then the end-to-end language tests in `../tests/`.

The lexer specification these tests encode lives in `../docs/lexer.md`.
